WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.868
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:04.304
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.304 --> 00:00:06.906
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:09.575
President Biden visited
an elementary school

00:00:09.575 --> 00:00:10.743
in New Jersey today,

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:13.346
and spoke about his
Build Back Better agenda,

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:16.749
though honestly, Build Back
Better is the worst phrase

00:00:16.749 --> 00:00:20.253
to say around a bunch of
unvaccinated kids.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:21.988
"We have to build back better!

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:24.590
Whoa."

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:27.126
A group of U.S. news
organizations last week

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.262
began publishing
a series of stories

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:31.030
based on
internal Facebook documents

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:33.232
showing that
the social media platform

00:00:33.232 --> 00:00:35.401
spreads misinformation,
incites violence,

00:00:35.401 --> 00:00:36.869
and facilitates
human trafficking.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:39.638
Even worse, it gives people
from high school

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:42.808
a way to get in touch with you.

00:00:42.808 --> 00:00:45.478
Facebook is reportedly
planning to change its name

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:46.646
amid increased scrutiny

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.448
of the social media platform's
harmful effects.

00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:50.550
"Hey, it worked for me,"

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:57.256
said stand-up comedian
Phil Jenkins.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:01:00.359
I knew that was him!

00:01:00.359 --> 00:01:04.130
Remember the whole show
I was saying,

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:08.435
"I've seen this Phil Jenkins
somewhere."

00:01:08.435 --> 00:01:10.603
"Politico" published a report
last week

00:01:10.603 --> 00:01:13.406
detailing President Biden's
extensive use of profanity

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:15.708
in private conversations
with aides.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:19.945
I'm sorry, did they think
the last guy didn't curse?

00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:23.049
He's from Queens,
he worked in construction,

00:01:23.049 --> 00:01:25.418
and he's a terrible golfer.

00:01:25.418 --> 00:01:27.853
That's the cursing hat trick.

00:01:27.853 --> 00:01:29.855
If they ever got the tapes
from his meetings,

00:01:29.855 --> 00:01:32.992
HBO couldn't air them.

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:35.261
During a Get Out the Vote rally
over the weekend in New York,

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.263
Senate Majority Leader
Chuck Schumer

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.732
posed for a picture
with a tuba

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:42.936
or more likely, it just
follows him everywhere he goes.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:46.339
[ Tuba playing ]

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:48.074
[ As Chuck Schumer ]
"We're making progress

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.542
on negotiations."

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:52.579
[ Tuba plays ]

00:01:56.282 --> 00:01:58.184
Actor Brad Pitt
recently announced

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:00.954
that his winery will release
a new rose champagne,

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:04.757
though women are more interested
in his pinot.

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:06.058
[ Applause ]

00:02:06.058 --> 00:02:08.628
No, don't you -- no! No!

00:02:08.628 --> 00:02:09.695
[ Cheering ]

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:12.798
There is a man named
Mike Scollins

00:02:12.798 --> 00:02:18.671
who wrote that joke,
and if we start rewarding him,

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:22.475
he will multiply.

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:24.744
Royal Caribbean recently
announced that it will offer

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.580
the longest cruise ever,
which will sail for 9 months

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.015
and visit all 7 continents,

00:02:29.015 --> 00:02:31.684
65 countries, and 11
great wonders of the world,

00:02:31.684 --> 00:02:36.722
and will feature at least
two new COVIDs.

00:02:36.722 --> 00:02:38.257
"Did you get me anything,
Grandma?"

00:02:38.257 --> 00:02:41.828
"The zeta."

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:43.596
McDonalds has announced
that next month,

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:46.532
it'll begin testing
its new meatless McPlant burger.

00:02:46.532 --> 00:02:49.435
"In that case,
just the cash in the register,"

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:52.805
said the Hamburglar.

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:56.241
"I'm going over to Wendy's."

00:02:56.241 --> 00:02:57.543
According to a new report

00:02:57.543 --> 00:02:59.044
published by
"Rolling Stone" magazine,

00:02:59.044 --> 00:03:01.180
multiple members of Congress
may have been involved

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:03.415
in the planning of the
January attack of the Capitol,

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:04.884
and I, for one, am shocked

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:06.852
that Congress had
anything to with it,

00:03:06.852 --> 00:03:10.756
because it nearly worked.

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:13.559
And finally, amid global
supply chain delays,

00:03:13.559 --> 00:03:15.494
toymakers are reportedly
planning to release

00:03:15.494 --> 00:03:18.431
more small, squishy toys
this holiday season,

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:21.134
because more can fit
in shipping containers.

00:03:21.134 --> 00:03:23.803
It's the same strategy
United Airlines uses

00:03:23.803 --> 00:03:26.072
for economy class.

00:03:26.072 --> 00:03:27.907
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

